---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/site';
---

<Base title="Disclosure" description="How this site earns, and what that does and does not change.">
  <div class="wrap" style="padding-top:44px">
    <h1>Disclosure</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2 style="margin-top:28px">How this site earns</h2>
      <p>{site.affiliate.disclosureLong}</p>
      <p>
        A commission is paid by Amazon out of its own margin. The price you pay is the same whether you
        arrive through a link here or type the product name into Amazon yourself.
      </p>

      <h2>What the commission does not change</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing on this site is ordered by commission rate. Watches are ranked on stated specification,
        price band, and how well the rating is evidenced — the same inputs for every entry, applied the
        same way. Featuring a watch on the homepage costs nothing and earns nothing extra.
      </p>

      <h2>What we have and have not done</h2>
      <p>
        We read the Amazon listing and the manufacturer's stated specification. We have not handled most
        of these watches, have not timed their movements, and have not tested their water resistance.
        Every page says so. Where a listing does not state something, that absence is printed as a caveat
        rather than filled in with a guess.
      </p>

      <h2>Prices</h2>
      <p>
        Prices are captured at a moment in time and stamped with that moment. Any price older than
        {site.price.maxAgeHours} hours is removed from the page automatically and replaced with a prompt
        to check the live listing, which is the only authoritative price.
      </p>

      <h2>Reviews and ratings</h2>
      <p>
        Where a rating appears it is the aggregate star rating Amazon displayed at the time of checking,
        with the number of ratings behind it. We do not reproduce customer review text, and we do not
        write reviews in a customer's voice.
      </p>

      <h2>Trademarks</h2>
      <p>
        Amazon and the Amazon logo are trademarks of Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates. {site.brand} is
        an independent site and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Amazon or by any watch
        manufacturer named here.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
